<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Giddings &amp; Lewis cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Giddings &amp; Lewis cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natwest Securities analyst Thomas Burns said he had cut Giddings &amp; Lewis to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said set unchanged earnings estimates of $1.10 per share for calendar year 1997.</p>
<p>-- said unable to project 12-month target price because company now the object of a $19-a-share tender offer by Harnischfeger Industries Inc.</p>
<p>-- Giddings &amp; Lewis fell 1/8 to 18-7/8 in morning trade.</p>
</text>
